---
// Aether Weaver's architecture (Figure 1 of the paper), redrawn as plain HTML
// so it follows the site's theme and stacks on phones.
---
<figure class="viz aw-arch" aria-label="Diagram of Aether Weaver. Your inputs feed a Narrative Arc Controller and an Affective Tone Mapper, which guide the Narrator. The Narrator and the Director work in a loop around a scene graph. A Visual Scene Generator draws each scene, and the system outputs text, the scene graph, images and soundscape cues.">
  <div class="viz__head">
    <p class="viz__title">How Aether Weaver fits together</p>
    <p class="viz__sub">One pass of this loop produces one scene: its text, its world state, its picture and its sound cues</p>
  </div>

  <div class="aw-arch__band">
    <p class="aw-arch__label">You choose</p>
    <ul class="aw-arch__chips">
      <li>Story premise</li><li>Characters &amp; setting</li><li>Narrative arc</li><li>Moods &amp; intensities</li><li>Visual style</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
  <div class="aw-arch__down" aria-hidden="true"></div>

  <div class="aw-arch__row aw-arch__row--guide">
    <div class="aw-arch__box aw-arch__box--guide">Narrative Arc Controller<small>Where are we in the plot, and what should this scene do?</small></div>
    <div class="aw-arch__side" aria-hidden="true"><span>stage's mood</span></div>
    <div class="aw-arch__box aw-arch__box--guide">Affective Tone Mapper<small>Turns moods into words, sounds and visual cues</small></div>
  </div>
  <div class="aw-arch__down" aria-hidden="true"><span>goal for the scene, mood directives</span></div>

  <div class="aw-arch__row aw-arch__row--loop">
    <div class="aw-arch__box aw-arch__box--main">Narrator<small>A large language model writes the scene and its sound cues</small></div>
    <div class="aw-arch__loop" aria-hidden="true">
      <span class="aw-arch__loop-a">scene text</span>
      <span class="aw-arch__loop-b">world state, corrections</span>
    </div>
    <div class="aw-arch__box aw-arch__box--main aw-arch__box--director">Director<small>Reads each scene and keeps the scene graph: who and what is where, and in what state</small></div>
  </div>
  <div class="aw-arch__down" aria-hidden="true"><span>text, scene graph, visual cues, style</span></div>

  <div class="aw-arch__row">
    <div class="aw-arch__box">Visual Scene Generator<small>Writes one detailed image prompt from everything above, then draws the scene</small></div>
  </div>
  <div class="aw-arch__down" aria-hidden="true"></div>

  <div class="aw-arch__band">
    <p class="aw-arch__label">You get</p>
    <ul class="aw-arch__chips aw-arch__chips--out">
      <li>Story text</li><li>Editable scene graph</li><li>Scene images</li><li>Soundscape cues</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <figcaption class="viz__caption">Redrawn from Figure 1 of the paper. Each box is a separate step; most of them are prompts to a language model.</figcaption>

  <style>
    .aw-arch__band { text-align: center; }
    .aw-arch__label { font-size: 0.78rem; font-variant: small-caps; letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: lowercase; color: var(--ink-2); margin-bottom: 0.4rem; }
    .aw-arch__chips { list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: center; gap: 0.4rem; }
    .aw-arch__chips li { font-size: 0.82rem; color: var(--ink); background: var(--bg-deep); border: 1px dashed var(--border); border-radius: 999px; padding: 0.25rem 0.75rem; }
    .aw-arch__chips--out li { border-style: solid; }
    .aw-arch__row { display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: stretch; }
    .aw-arch__row > .aw-arch__box { flex: 1 1 0; max-width: 22rem; }
    .aw-arch__box {
      border-radius: 12px; padding: 0.6rem 0.8rem; text-align: center; font-size: 0.92rem; font-weight: 600; color: var(--ink); line-height: 1.3;
      background: var(--viz-surface); border: 1px solid var(--border); box-shadow: var(--shadow-card);
    }
    .aw-arch__box small { display: block; font-weight: 400; font-size: 0.78rem; color: var(--ink-2); margin-top: 0.2rem; }
    .aw-arch__box--guide { background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent-to) 7%, var(--viz-surface)); }
    .aw-arch__box--main { border-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent-from) 55%, var(--border)); background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent-from) 7%, var(--viz-surface)); }
    .aw-arch__side, .aw-arch__loop { flex: 0 0 7.5rem; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; align-items: center; gap: 0.35rem; font-size: 0.74rem; color: var(--ink-2); text-align: center; padding-inline: 0.3rem; }
    .aw-arch__side span { border-bottom: 2px solid var(--axis); padding-bottom: 0.15rem; }
    .aw-arch__side span::after { content: " →"; }
    .aw-arch__loop span { display: block; }
    .aw-arch__loop-a::after { content: " →"; }
    .aw-arch__loop-b::before { content: "← "; }
    .aw-arch__down { position: relative; height: 2.1rem; display: flex; justify-content: center; }
    .aw-arch__down::before { content: ""; width: 2px; height: 100%; background: var(--axis); }
    .aw-arch__down::after { content: ""; position: absolute; bottom: -1px; left: 50%; transform: translateX(-50%); border: 5px solid transparent; border-top-color: var(--axis); border-bottom: 0; }
    .aw-arch__down span { position: absolute; left: calc(50% + 0.6rem); top: 50%; transform: translateY(-50%); font-size: 0.74rem; color: var(--ink-2); white-space: nowrap; }
    @media (max-width: 640px) {
      .aw-arch__row { flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 0.35rem; }
      .aw-arch__row > .aw-arch__box { width: 100%; max-width: none; }
      .aw-arch__side, .aw-arch__loop { flex: none; flex-direction: row; gap: 0.8rem; }
      .aw-arch__side span::after { content: " ↓"; }
      .aw-arch__side span { border: 0; }
      .aw-arch__loop-a::after { content: " ↓"; }
      .aw-arch__loop-b::before { content: "↑ "; }
      .aw-arch__down { height: 3rem; }
      .aw-arch__down span { white-space: normal; max-width: 40%; }
    }
  </style>
</figure>
